SEARCH_PROVIDER=deepseek
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=xxxxxxxx
DEEPSEEK_SEARCH_MODEL=deepseek-flash
# Paid network search is OFF by default: every real search call costs money and must be
# authorised deliberately. Uncomment the next line (and set a cap) only when you intend to
# spend. GUANLAN_PAID_SEARCH_MAX limits calls per backend run; omit it for no cap.
# GUANLAN_ALLOW_PAID_SEARCH=1
# GUANLAN_PAID_SEARCH_MAX=10
# Alternative: SEARCH_PROVIDER=brave and BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY=your-key
# Current valid model names per the official docs and GET https://api.deepseek.com/models:
#   deepseek-flash, deepseek-v4-pro
# The legacy name deepseek-v4-flash is retired (routed to V4.1 Flash for compatibility only),
# and deepseek-chat / deepseek-reasoner are discontinued. Do not use them.
# Web search is reached through the Anthropic-compatible endpoint below. Note that the tool
# identifier web_search_20250305 is Anthropic's convention and is NOT documented by DeepSeek,
# so any change here must be verified with a live call before it is trusted.
# The key is sent only as the x-api-key header and is never echoed in errors or logs.
# .env is read once at backend start, so restart the server after changing it.
